I close my umbrella.
The weather is suddenly beautiful.
I do not go to the U-Bahn immediately.
I stay here by the canal.
The sun is shining brightly.
It is the first real sunshine this year.
The whole city suddenly looks different.
There are people everywhere.
Everyone wants to enjoy the good weather.
I walk slowly along the water.
It is sunny.
It is also not so cold anymore.
Jonas and the weather forecast are right.
It will stay beautiful this afternoon.
Many people are walking their dogs.
Some are sitting on the benches.
They talk and laugh.
A man rides slowly past on his bicycle.
I am happy about spring in Berlin.
